sequenceDiagram
  participant Client
  participant DNS
  participant Nginx as Nginx Ingress
  participant Service as ClusterIP Service
  participant Pod
  Client->>DNS: resolve oriso-dev.site host
  DNS-->>Client: ingress controller address
  Client->>Nginx: HTTPS request
  Nginx->>Nginx: TLS and regex rewrite
  Nginx->>Service: route to oriso-platform-* service
  Service->>Pod: forward to selected pod
